\nhttps://imgur.com/a/yurpzie-2-0-design-reference-occ7Nga", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@jirosakusakuta/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d5e0f7d0/uploads/origins/b9245014-752a-4d36-b1c8-204d3d30ce66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6228a46686c117a99f36943458b8f79", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d5e0f7d0/uploads/origins/b9245014-752a-4d36-b1c8-204d3d30ce66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6228a46686c117a99f36943458b8f79, https://si.imgix.net/d5e0f7d0/uploads/origins/b9245014-752a-4d36-b1c8-204d3d30ce66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=807e58412cf24e9b28daccc0bb814965 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d5e0f7d0/uploads/origins/b9245014-752a-4d36-b1c8-204d3d30ce66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=977358952402d8b272afbef6334033d9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！！！\n\n前回先生の素敵なイラストを本当にありがとうございました！ すごく気に入っています。今回は水着姿のナハトを描いていただけませんでしょうか？ 先生の自由な発想でお願いします！\n\nありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1fVGPlxvdwN5cjQ7opsglBiwMq8Z7-W-P?sort=13&direction=a&fd=true", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@jirosakusakuta/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f56f349b/uploads/origins/f1185c11-1e76-44b1-9c96-ba0bfa5474dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76e14f7793eb01aff8f25494c62e4f23", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f56f349b/uploads/origins/f1185c11-1e76-44b1-9c96-ba0bfa5474dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76e14f7793eb01aff8f25494c62e4f23, https://si.imgix.net/f56f349b/uploads/origins/f1185c11-1e76-44b1-9c96-ba0bfa5474dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1cab6bd6aebb7b0bdf422504354bc23 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f56f349b/uploads/origins/f1185c11-1e76-44b1-9c96-ba0bfa5474dd?b